{"text": "截至2025年3月31日，公司总资产为27,118,584,850.11元，较上年末的26,217,544,719.07元增长；总负债为6,980,583,129.65元，较上年末的6,482,002,827.11元增长。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "高", "topics": ["总资产", "总负债"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 2, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "78f516e5"}}
{"text": "2025年第一季度实现营业收入2,173,278,385.62元，较上年同期的1,605,024,097.68元增长35.4%；营业成本1,270,562,411.05元，较上年同期的922,716,627.53元增长37.7%。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "高", "topics": ["营业收入", "营业成本"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 2, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "03d51ac0"}}
{"text": "2025年第一季度研发费用为464,353,795.33元，较上年同期的214,189,022.44元增长116.8%。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "高", "topics": ["研发费用"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 2, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "01e387e7"}}
{"text": "截至2025年3月31日，应收账款为1,590,778,150.74元，较上年末的1,352,336,466.74元增长；存货为7,447,743,919.18元，较上年末的7,038,518,704.32元增长。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "中性", "importance": "中", "topics": ["应收账款", "存货"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 2, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "232c2968"}}
{"text": "截至2025年3月31日，归属于母公司所有者权益为20,144,123,516.91元，较上年末的19,736,912,284.36元增长；未分配利润为5,312,511,073.33元，较上年末的4,999,428,615.62元增长。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "高", "topics": ["所有者权益", "未分配利润"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 2, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "d7e79dc7"}}
{"text": "其他收益为49,461,752.56元，较上年同期的5,988,719.46元大幅增长。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "中", "topics": ["其他收益", "增长"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 3, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "9b48df20"}}
{"text": "投资收益为-12,012,219.16元，上年同期为-4,448,280.94元，亏损扩大。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "负面", "importance": "中", "topics": ["投资收益", "亏损"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 3, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "384829b7"}}
