{"text": "信用减值损失为856,511.39元，上年同期为-16,010,053.58元，损失减少。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "低", "topics": ["信用减值损失", "减少"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 3, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "b6b55e21"}}
{"text": "资产减值损失为-2,188,238.32元，上年同期为-9,845,742.89元，损失减少。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "低", "topics": ["资产减值损失", "减少"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 3, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "7fbf83eb"}}
{"text": "资产处置收益为3,438,166.21元，上年同期无此项目。", "category": "财务", "sentiment": "正面", "importance": "低", "topics": ["资产处置收益"], "entities": ["中微公司"], "chunk_index": 3, "_meta": {"source": "financial_reports/quarterly/中微公司：2025年第一季度报告.md", "company": "中微公司", "doc_type": "quarterly_report", "segmented_at": "2026-04-25 19:51", "id": "7250ac4b"}}
